      "comment": "Classically a four-wheeled travelling carriage, a Gaulish word (Quint. 1.5.57; Caes. BG 1.51.2; Cic. Mil. 28, all from Lewis &amp; Short). Traupman and Andresian use it for the car itself; <span lang=\"la\">autoraeda</span> says which kind of carriage."
    },
